# Build context allowlist (deny-all, then admit inputs of docker/Dockerfile).
# Extend deliberately: if the Dockerfile COPYs it, allowlist it.
**
!modules/
!modules/apt.sh
!modules/apps.sh
!packages/
!packages/apt/
!packages/apt/base.txt
!packages/apps/
!packages/apps/claude.txt
!packages/apps/opencode.txt
!toolchains/
!toolchains/mise.toml
!toolchains/mise.lock
!docker/
!docker/Dockerfile
